= Our connections

We can use, or establish connections in the military.

- @spread_socialism: We can spread socialism among the lower ranks of the military.
- @sabotage: We can sabotage the military.
- @militarize: Start a scheme to siphon military equipment into the Reichsbanner.
- @return: Perhaps another time.
- @easy_discard

@spread_socialism
subtitle: We will use our spies to do this. -1 resource.
choose-if: resources > 0
on-arrival: left_sympathies += 0.05 if spy_network < 6; left_sympathies += 0.1 if spy_network >=6

[? if spy_network < 6 : We spread propaganda among on lower ranks of the military, but it does seem to be effective. ?]

[? if spy_network >= 6 : Using our pervasive spy network, we can spread our propaganda thoroughly. ?]


